---
import whereAmImg    from '../../assets/where_am.png';
import surroundsImg  from '../../assets/01.png';
import changedImg    from '../../assets/changed.png';
---

<style>
  .number-outline {
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
    color: transparent;
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 8rem);
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>

<section class="py-16 md:py-[120px]" data-purpose="three-questions">
  <div class="px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-16">
    <h2 class="text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-primary mb-10 md:mb-32 max-w-xl">
      Every autonomous system must answer three questions.
    </h2>

    <!-- Question 01 -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-20 items-center mb-16 md:mb-40">
      <div>
        <span class="number-outline">01</span>
        <h3 class="text-[32px] md:text-[48px] lg:text-[56px] font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mt-2 mb-6 text-primary">
          Where am I?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-body-lg font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-md">
          Absolute positioning is a prerequisite. Spatia provides sub-centimeter spatial awareness
          even in GPS-denied environments.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3]">
        <img src={whereAmImg.src} alt="Spatial Positioning" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Question 02 -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-20 items-center mb-16 md:mb-40">
      <div class="order-2 md:order-1 rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3]">
        <img src={surroundsImg.src} alt="Environmental Awareness" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
        <span class="number-outline">02</span>
        <h3 class="text-[32px] md:text-[48px] lg:text-[56px] font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mt-2 mb-6 text-primary">
          What surrounds me?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-body-lg font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-md">
          Environmental awareness isn't just about obstacles; it's about identifying actors, intent,
          and long-term structures.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Question 03 -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-20 items-center">
      <div>
        <span class="number-outline">03</span>
        <h3 class="text-[32px] md:text-[48px] lg:text-[56px] font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mt-2 mb-6 text-primary">
          What changed?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-body-lg font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-md">
          Autonomy thrives on Delta. Recognizing what has shifted since the last observation creates
          true operational intelligence.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3]">
        <img src={changedImg.src} alt="Change Detection" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
